r-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "c3cff4d8-918f-53b3-942b-69a690472772" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-1" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186414516}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "c3cff4d8-918f-53b3-942b-69a690472772" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-1" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186414516} :answer-field/id #uuid "fd2dd150-cbf8-5943-a9f9-3a6a93823e7c" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045492 :db/ident :answer-field.type/blank} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186414539}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045487 :db/ident :question.difficulty/moderate} :question/id #uuid "8e611e5f-9b0f-54fb-976f-649d34b87a37" :question/math-academy-id "q-332581" :question/problem "$$\n{\\begin{aligned}{x}_{1}^{′}(t)=-{x}_{1}(t)+3{x}_{2}(t)+2{t}^{2}-t+1 \\\\ {x}_{2}^{′}(t)=2{x}_{1}(t)-2{x}_{2}(t)+{t}^{2}+4t-3\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe systems of linear ODEs above can be written in matrix form as follows:\n\n| ${x}^{′}(t)=\\,\\,$ |  | {{field-1}} | {{field-2}} |  | $\\,\\,x(t)+\\,\\,$ |  | {{field-3}} |  |  | $\\,\\,{t}^{2}\\,\\,+\\,\\,$ |  | {{field-4}} |  |  | $\\,\\,t+\\,\\,$ |  | {{field-5}} |  |  |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n|  | {{field-6}} | {{field-7}} |  |  | {{field-8}} |  |  | {{field-9}} |  |  | {{field-10}} |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |" :question/worked-solution "First, let's rewrite our system, highlighting the coefficients:\n\n$$\n{\\begin{aligned}{x}_{1}^{′}(t)=(-1)\\cdot {x}_{1}(t)+3\\cdot {x}_{2}(t)+2\\cdot {t}^{2}+(-1)\\cdot t+1 \\\\ {x}_{2}^{′}(t)=2\\cdot {x}_{1}(t)+(-2)\\cdot {x}_{2}(t)+1\\cdot {t}^{2}+4\\cdot t+(-3)\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow, we can write the system in matrix form:\n\n$$\n{x}^{′}(t)=[\\begin{aligned}-1 & 3 \\\\ 2 & -2\\end{aligned}]x(t)+[\\begin{aligned}2 \\\\ 1\\end{aligned}]{t}^{2}+[\\begin{aligned}-1 \\\\ 4\\end{aligned}]t+[\\begin{aligned}1 \\\\ -3\\end{aligned}]\n$$\n\nwhere $x(t)=[\\begin{aligned}{x}_{1}(t) \\\\ {x}_{2}(t)\\end{aligned}].$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186305062 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186166902 :knowledge-point/id #uuid "51834713-edc2-5af3-a0dc-fb54ea4040c6" :knowledge-point/title "Writing Down an Inhomogeneous System of Linear ODEs in Matrix Form"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "4f392140-d91b-53a6-90cd-d3e6edbee0ea" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "2" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186302953}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "4f392140-d91b-53a6-90cd-d3e6edbee0ea" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "2" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186302953} :answer-field/id #uuid "1b07a5bb-87b1-50cf-94c8-1f9b160778b5" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045492 :db/ident :answer-field.type/blank} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186304145} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "0f405964-62e8-577d-8237-7ea766af47e6" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "3" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186302557}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "0f405964-62e8-577d-8237-7ea766af47e6" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "3" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186302557} :answer-field/id #uuid "3d010691-a9d5-58f5-971d-d06b38541ac4" :answer-field/key "field-2" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045492 :db/ident :answer-field.type/blank} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186304243} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "ecb50152-67cb-5b58-a801-9b477c420bac" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "1" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186303941}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "ecb50152-67cb-5b58-a801-9b477c420bac" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :ans